---
title: Badge
description: Small inline label for statuses, counts or categories. Set data-variant to change its color.
tags: [feedback, css]
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<span class="badge">Default</span>
<span class="badge" data-variant="success">Stable</span>
<span class="badge" data-variant="warning">Beta</span>
<span class="badge" data-variant="danger">Deprecated</span>
